    "Face a window for soft daylight, with a plain background and only you in the photo. Avoid backlighting, blur and beauty filters.": "面向窗户，利用柔和的自然光，选择简洁的背景，照片中只保留你本人。避免逆光、模糊和美颜滤镜。",
    "Keep the camera at eye level. Include your whole head, hair and shoulders, with a relaxed expression or gentle smile.": "相机与眼睛保持同一高度。完整拍入头部、头发和肩膀，表情放松或自然微笑。",
    "Keep your usual hairstyle: long, short, curly, straight, shaved or no hair are all welcome. Move any hair covering your eyes or cheeks aside for at least one photo.": "保留平时的发型：长发、短发、卷发、直发、剃发或没有头发都可以。至少有一张照片应将遮住眼睛或脸颊的头发拨开。",
    "Everyday makeup, facial hair and your usual head covering are fine. If you wear glasses, keep your eyes visible and avoid glare; take off sunglasses.": "日常妆容、胡须以及平时佩戴的头部遮盖物都可以保留。如果戴眼镜，请确保眼睛清晰可见并避免镜片反光；请摘下太阳镜。",
    "Choose your favourite uploaded headshot below. Pick a clear photo that genuinely looks like you.": "在下方选择你最喜欢的已上传头像照。请选择清晰且真正像你本人的照片。",
    "Add headshots": "添加头像照",
    "Dressed full-body photos": "穿着完整服装的全身照",
