    "Wear comfortable everyday clothes that follow your natural outline without squeezing, such as a simple top with trousers or leggings. Avoid bulky layers, loose coats and bags hiding your shape.": "穿舒适的日常服装，让衣服贴合自然轮廓但不勒紧，例如简单上衣搭配长裤或打底裤。避免厚重叠穿、宽松外套以及遮挡身形的包。",
    "Use a natural upright posture, relaxed shoulders and arms slightly away from your sides. Keep your feet visible; avoid posed twists or sucking in your stomach.": "自然站直，放松肩膀，双臂稍微离开身体两侧。双脚应完整可见；避免扭身摆拍或收腹。",
    "If long hair covers your shoulders or torso, move it behind your shoulders for at least one body photo. Keep your usual hairstyle in your headshots.": "如果长发遮住肩膀或躯干，请至少在一张全身照中将头发拨到肩后。头像照中保留平时的发型即可。",
    "Ask someone to help or use a timer. Place the camera level around mid-torso height, a few steps away, using the standard 1× lens. Avoid tilted angles, ultra-wide lenses and mirror selfies.": "请他人帮忙或使用定时拍摄。将相机摆正，大约放在躯干中部的高度，与身体相隔几步，使用标准 1× 镜头。避免倾斜角度、超广角镜头和镜子自拍。",
    "Use even light and a simple background. Keep the photo unfiltered: body-shaping edits make proportions harder to judge.": "使用均匀的光线和简洁的背景。照片不要加滤镜：改变身形的修图会让比例更难判断。",
    "Add full-body photos": "添加全身照",
    "PNG or JPG, up to 10 MB each. Photos are resized and metadata removed. They stay private to you and the administrator. Uploading does not automatically generate images.": "支持 PNG 或 JPG，每张不超过 10 MB。照片会缩小尺寸并移除元数据，仅对你和管理员开放。上传照片不会自动生成图片。",
    "Refresh photos": "刷新照片",
    "Their photos. Their own space.": "他们的照片。专属的空间。",
    "Add a headshot, a dressed full-body photo, or both. Photos belong only to the selected family profile.": "可添加头像照、穿着完整服装的全身照，或两者都添加。照片仅属于当前选中的家庭成员资料。",
    "I have permission to upload these photos as a parent, legal guardian or with this adult’s consent.": "我有权以父母或法定监护人的身份上传这些照片，或已获得这位成年人的同意。",
    "A clear headshot is used as this person’s profile picture.": "一张清晰的头像照会用作此人的个人资料头像。",
    "PNG or JPG, up to 10 MB each. Photos are resized and metadata removed. Only your account can access them. No AI images are generated from family photos.": "支持 PNG 或 JPG，每张不超过 10 MB。照片会缩小尺寸并移除元数据，仅能通过你的账户访问。不会使用家庭成员照片生成 AI 图片。",
    "PNG or JPG, up to 10 MB each. Photos are resized and metadata removed. Only your account can access them. AI generation is optional in Virtual try-on and requires your separate provider consent.": "支持 PNG 或 JPG，每张不超过 10 MB。照片会缩小尺寸并移除元数据，仅能通过你的账户访问。虚拟试衣中的 AI 图像生成是可选功能，需要你另行同意由所选服务商处理。"
