    "Face a window for soft daylight, with a plain background and only you in the photo. Avoid backlighting, blur and beauty filters.": "面向窗戶，利用柔和嘅自然光，揀簡單背景，相入面只得你一個人。避免背光、模糊同美顏濾鏡。",
