    "Use a natural upright posture, relaxed shoulders and arms slightly away from your sides. Keep your feet visible; avoid posed twists or sucking in your stomach.": "自然企直，放鬆膊頭，雙手同身體兩側稍為保持距離。要影到雙腳；唔好扭身擺姿勢或者縮肚。",
